cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PCCP-Bench, cite the archived version below (0.1.3). If you use the candidate pool, cite it separately and note it is not frozen."
title: "PCCP-Bench: a reproducible decision bench for FDA predetermined change control plan (PCCP) scope judgements"
type: dataset
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: 10.5281/zenodo.24551199
    description: "Version 0.1.3 archive (concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24550266)"
version: "0.1.3"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
url: "https://github.com/LGD-Eval/pccp-bench"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A small, byte-verifiable decision bench for the question "is this change covered by the
  authorized PCCP, or does it need a new submission?". The archive is pinned by sha256 and a
  Merkle root recomputed by CI on GitHub's own infrastructure; the reference adapter reproduces
  exact public=0.9688 and masked=0.9688 on the 32 public cases. Those numbers are scope-limited
  to this bench's own cases and must not be read as decision capability. The 37-case candidate
  pool, its errata, and the per-case label-vs-judge disagreement record are published separately.
keywords:
  - predetermined change control plan
  - PCCP
  - medical device
  - AI/ML
  - benchmark
  - reproducible evaluation
authors:
